@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 文件操作（重命名/移动/复制/删除）时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件列表页\n(files/List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as FileCtrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as FileSvc
database "File/Folder Repository\n(MySQL)" as DB

== 重命名 ==
User -> UI: 输入新名称
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/files/{fileId}/rename\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n{ name }
Axios -> FileCtrl: renameFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: renameFile(fileId, userId, name)
FileSvc -> DB: 校验归属 + 更新 originalFilename
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { fileId, filename }
Axios --> UI: 成功提示

== 移动 ==
User -> UI: 选择目标文件夹
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/{fileId}/move\n{ folderId }
Axios -> FileCtrl: moveFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: moveFile(fileId, userId, folderId)
FileSvc -> DB: 加载文件与目标文件夹并更新归属
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { fileId, folderId }

== 复制 ==
User -> UI: 选择目标文件夹
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/{fileId}/copy\n{ folderId }
Axios -> FileCtrl: copyFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: copyFile(fileId, userId, folderId)
FileSvc -> DB: 复制记录并保存
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { fileId, filename }

== 删除（移入回收站） ==
User -> UI: 确认删除
UI -> Axios: DELETE /api/files/{fileId}
Axios -> FileCtrl: deleteFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: deleteFile(fileId, userId)
FileSvc -> DB: 标记 deleted=true, deleteTime=now
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { quotaUsed, quotaLimit }
Axios --> UI: 成功提示并刷新

@enduml

